{
  "caveats": [
    "These are national administrative reports, not hazard probabilities, event boundaries or estimates of future risk. Only the five published hazard categories are included. The summary does not establish whether affected people are counted more than once across events or categories, so the figures must not be summed as unique people. No district detail, asset losses or service-disruption measures are provided.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
